    "text": "A screenshot of a definition pop-up titled 'BulkHardware'. Summary: 'Products or commodities produced as a bulk unit are called bulk products. Commodities are often sold in bulk.' Description: 'Products or commodities produced as a bulk unit are called bulk products. Commodities are often sold in bulk based on a batch or bulk ID number associated with the bulk unit. Bulk units defined in the QUDT Units standards.' Metadata: 'https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Hardware/BulkHardware'; Instantiability 'Concrete'; SubclassOf 'Hardware'.",
